            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پدربزرگم در بازار یک حجره داشت. Pedarbozorgam dar bâzâr yek hojre dâsht. My grandfather had a shop in the bazaar."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Arabic plural hojarât. Also a student's cell in an old school."
            }
          ]
        },
