              "text": "تیمچه (timche) — \"a covered hall in the bazaar, an arcade\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فرشها را در تیمچه میفروشند. Farsh-hâ râ dar timche miforushand. They sell the carpets in the covered hall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A timche is often domed and finely built, a hall for wholesale trade."
